  (text "Supply input, F1, ideal diode U1/Q6 (blocks regen into the PSU)" (at 25.4 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c297c5c0-0d50-5b3a-9825-6b5499c49d3d"))
  (text "K1 main contactor (chassis) and coil driver Q4 (12 V gate drive from U9 channel B)" (at 25.4 163.4225 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25c214a0-492f-50b6-8a8f-decc1bb5a41e"))
  (text "K2 pre-charge relay + R3 (RH-50, chassis); +24V_L feed" (at 213.5755 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e33065b8-a891-54d3-8152-299d0a6d492e"))
  (text "Bulk capacitor C1 (star point PGND/GND), arm branch: U19 current sensor, F3" (at 389.717 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2e7ec52a-fa10-5828-b828-64c5cc96ce2f"))
  (text "Logic supply: F2 → U2 24→12 V → U3 3.3 V (watchdog/logic only), U32 5 V for U19" (at 389.717 151.405 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "eed36eea-290b-5c30-8916-bc9704d0b763"))
  (text "Power path: PSU+ -> F1 (60 A MIDI, chassis) -> J2 -> Q6/U1 ideal diode -> VIN -> J4 -> K1 (chassis) -> J5 -> VBUS.\nPre-charge: VIN -> K2 (NO, pin 4) -> J6 -> R3/RH-50 3.3 ohm (drawn R5, chassis) -> VBUS. K2 coil and K1 coil both hang on COIL+, after S1a-S2a.\nK1 coil: +24V_L -> S1a -> S2a -> COIL+ -> coil -> COIL- -> Q4 (100 V) -> PGND; D1 + Z1 across the coil (clamp ~50 V).\nQ4 is driven at 12 V from U9 OUTB (design change 1); its logic command is U8_OUT = LATCH & WD_OK & (PRE_OK | AUX_DB).\nPGND (power return) and GND (logic) meet only at NT2, at C1-. VBUS_SNS is Kelvin-tied to VBUS at NT1 (J5)." (at 25.4 383 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aaf8b7c3-26e3-53f8-a96a-ab2e3a6ad893"))
